      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220555/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rinse corned beef brisket and pat dry. Rub with brown sugar, including the bottom, and gently place brisket into the slow cooker with the stout beer.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
